icons/8b9a4582016210723532907414759e69.png","desc":"This weapon gains bonus stability, handling, and reload speed while the wielder is in motion."},{"name":"Steady Hands","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/ed60dd27f28737cbfc77bf41c3784c01.png","desc":"Kills provide improved handling for all weapons for a short duration."}]},{"label":"Trait","weight":3,"perks":[{"name":"Under Pressure","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/ac8ec81cd8139434a4b19e459bd9b8ff.png","desc":"Improved stability and accuracy as the magazine gets lower."},{"name":"Kill Clip","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/0afd4799427004b2d8170ab213a2ef0c.png","desc":"Reloading after a kill grants increased damage."},{"name":"Adrenaline Junkie","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/6f8bde03140b53e6dc583ada1aeaa51d.png","desc":"This weapon gains increased damage and handling from final blows with grenades or this weapon."},{"name":"Desperate Measures","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/25692d31f4963c07c3a82aba508b52b6.png","desc":"Weapon final blows grant bonus damage. Melee and grenade final blows grant a larger damage bonus that can stack."},{"name":"Frenzy","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/23e06f4ced1b3e6476f342978ff5bb37.png","desc":"Being in combat for an extended time increases damage, handling, and reload for this weapon until you are out of combat."},{"name":"Headseeker","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/bdca577f8850f3c6168e9bc055019934.png","desc":"Body shots landed with this weapon increase precision damage and aim assist for a short time. Body shots landed while the perk is active refresh the time."},{"name":"Incandescent","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/22ed4a2cd5a0eb129a14ce77db49373f.png","desc":"Defeating a target spreads scorch to those nearby.\nMore powerful combatants and opposing Guardians cause scorch in a larger radius."},{"name":"Wellspring","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/ec2e3096ebd447bd6137735c9067b991.png","desc":"Kills with this weapon generate ability energy. This energy is divided between your uncharged abilities."},{"name":"Unrelenting","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/1e5843177c71ae3f2a4770d01a2f3813.png","desc":"Rapidly defeating targets triggers health regeneration. Guardians and powerful combatants count as more than one kill."},{"name":"Multikill Clip","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/3749921a74a378259228d5e989459311.png","desc":"Reloading grants increased damage based on the number of rapid final blows made beforehand."},{"name":"Dragonfly","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/c87b03bb6d56b393f8582e128b337332.png","desc":"Precision kills create an elemental damage explosion."},{"name":"Golden Tricorn","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/8ad63f37f2513f56892e0ed20621f5dc.png","desc":"Final blows with this weapon grant bonus damage. While this buff is active, grenade or melee kills of the same damage type greatly increase its damage and duration."},{"name":"Adaptive Munitions","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/3b952f8ba0c9afce1a0cc081d23ece03.png","desc":"This weapon adapts its damage output and effectiveness against energy shields that don't match the weapon's damage type."},{"name":"Gutshot Straight","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/5c4c785bde7b9808d48ded283256750e.png","desc":"Aiming down sights increases body shot damage, decreases target acquisition."},{"name":"Golden Tricorn Enhanced","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/8ad63f37f2513f56892e0ed20621f5dc.png","desc":"Final blows with this weapon grant bonus damage for an improved duration. While this buff is active, grenade or melee final blows of the same damage type greatly increase its damage for an improved duration."},{"name":"Encore","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/857b00161b9794fdd62261adf02c6a5e.png","desc":"Final blows grant a stacking stability, range, and accuracy bonus to this weapon. Precision final blows grant more stacks."},{"name":"Collective Action","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/90